  "priorExpiration": "2009-11-11",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5004.07 Sole Use of Building. Pursuant to RSA 160-B:6, III-a, any building used for the storage, sale, or both of fireworks, shall be dedicated solely to the storage, sale, or both of fireworks and items relating to the sale and promotion of fireworks as permitted by these rules.\n\nSource. #7481, eff 4-25-01, EXPIRED: 4-25-09\n\nNew. #9471, INTERIM, eff 5-15-09, EXPIRED: 11-11-09\n\nNew. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
